commit 528e26a58a724c46e09876b5923d69472f2a81fb

C03: a message request without a client asks which one and the answer completes it (MSGSEND1847 left H0198/H0231/H0536/H0024 open): a dictation colon after the addressee or a bare «que» carries the text, a client named inside the dictated text is not the channel, and a one-word channel answer («por WhatsApp», «wsp», «Discord») rebuilds the person's request with that client so the ordinary send reader accepts it; «que diga:» and «diciendo que» prefixes are stripped from the text

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


