commit 07d4f4505c7b0daf0b6d9f3d1bcd340d24b46474

C03: the delivery read widens the newest-bubble band when the narrow right-end band does not show the sent text (MSGCLAR1851 case 0: «prueba 1 de WhatsApp, ya funciona de nuevo» really sent to Música, its bubble wider than 320 px, read as «atsApp, ya funciona de nuevo» and refused as message_delivery_not_verified); the narrow band stays first because a short bubble drowned in the wallpaper over the full band

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


